  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "とりポケモンに　おそわれると\nくろい　こなを　まきちらす。\nふれると　マヒする　どくのこなだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "새포켓몬에게 습격당하면\n검은 가루를 흩뿌린다.\n만지면 마비되는 독가루다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lorsqu’il est poursuivi par un Pokémon Oiseau,\nil projette une poudre noire qui paralyse tous ceux\nqu’elle touche.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wird es von einem fliegenden Pokémon angegriffen,\nverstreut es schwarzen Puder. Der giftige Puder löst\nbei Berührung Paralyse aus.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando recibe el ataque de un Pokémon pájaro,\nexpulsa unas escamas negras que provocan parálisis\nsi se entra en contacto con ellas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se assalito da Pokémon uccello, si difende emettendo\nvelenose scaglie nere che paralizzano al minimo\ncontatto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When under attack from bird Pokémon,\nit spews a poisonous black powder\nthat causes paralysis on contact.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "とりポケモンに　襲われると\n黒い　粉を　まき散らす。\n触れると　マヒする　毒の粉だ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando recibe el ataque de un Pokémon pájaro,\nexpulsa unas escamas negras que provocan parálisis\nsi se entra en contacto con ellas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "からだを　おおう　こなが　たいおんを\nちょうせつするので　どんな　きこうや\nふうどの　ちいきでも　くらせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "몸을 덮은 가루가 체온을\n조절하고 있어 어떤 기후나\n풍토의 지역에서도 살 수 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La poudre qui recouvre son corps l’aide à réguler\nsa température. Il peut s’adapter à tous les climats.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es reguliert seine Körpertemperatur mit dem Puder,\ndas seinen Körper bedeckt, und kommt deswegen\nin jedem Klima und jeder Region zurecht.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gracias al polvo de escamas que lo recubre y regula\nsu temperatura, puede vivir en cualquier región, sin\nimportar las características del terreno o el clima.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La sua temperatura corporea è regolata dalle scaglie\nche ne ricoprono il corpo. Grazie ad esse può adattarsi\ne sopravvivere in qualsiasi condizione climatica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The powder that covers its body\nregulates its temperature, so it\ncan live in any region or climate.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
